  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 5.0% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $279.15B (5.0% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stablecoin supply drops $14.2 billion in largest contraction since 2022 bear market</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-12-bitgo-expands-institutional-stablecoin-minting-and-redemption-platform-with-usdc-438525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BitGo expands institutional stablecoin minting and redemption platform with USDC</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-12-tether-gold-issuer-follows-usdt-to-complete-big-four-audit-438849\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tether Gold issuer follows USDT to complete Big Four audit</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
